  "notes": "King Legacy is a One Piece inspired adventure game on Roblox from Sea King Games. You sail between islands, finish quests to level up toward a cap of 5,450, and put points into stats like melee, sword and devil fruit. Fruits such as Dragon, Dough and Buddha spawn on the map every hour or two, and the fruit you land shapes how you fight.\n\nMost codes give 2x EXP for 30 minutes, cash, gems or a free stat reset. Stat resets are the most valuable because they let you move all your points after switching to a new fruit or weapon, which normally costs gems. The game has gone a long time without a big update, so new codes are rare, but they have always arrived with major updates and group milestones announced in the Discord.",
